A-Stock Data TDX Daily provider

This package's TDX daily archive parser is derived from the upstream project
[a-stock-data](https://github.com/williamxhero/a-stock-data), revision
`29b07d2e37005b9fd568bca1262f6e572b5f9407` (Apache License 2.0). The upstream
license text is included in `LICENSE`.

Modified for QuoteMux: the archive parser and field extraction are adapted to
the source-package handler contract; stock identity is checked by market/code,
requests are restricted to one exact date and unadjusted daily bars, and
immutable daily ZIP artifacts are cached locally. ST status is inferred only
from an explicit TDX name marker; suspension state is not inferred.
